/-!
# The conormal sheaf of a regular closed immersion of codimension `c` has rank `c`

Let `i : Z ⟶ X` be a closed immersion which is regular of codimension `c`
(`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.RegularIdealSheaf.IsRegularClosedImmersionOfCodim`): its ideal sheaf
is locally generated by a regular sequence of `c` sections. Then the conormal sheaf
`𝒞_{Z/X} = 𝓘/𝓘²` is finite locally free of rank `c` (Stacks 063N, with the rank of 0BQZ).

Around a point of `Z` there is an affine open of `X` over which the kernel of `i` on sections is
generated by a weakly regular, hence quasi-regular, sequence of length `c` (Stacks 063G, 00LN);
over such a chart the conormal sheaf has fibre rank `c`
(`Stacks.Conormal.fiberRank_conormalSheaf_eq_of_isQuasiRegular`), and a finite locally free sheaf
of constant fibre rank `c` is finite locally free of rank `c`.

## Main results

* `IsRegularClosedImmersionOfCodim.isFiniteLocallyFreeOfRank_conormalModule`: the conormal sheaf
  of a regular closed immersion of codimension `c` is finite locally free of rank `c`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 063N](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/063N)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 063G](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/063G)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0BQZ](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BQZ)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits

universe u

namespace Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.RegularIdealSheaf

/-- **The conormal sheaf of a regular closed immersion of codimension `c` is finite locally free
of rank `c`.** -/
@[sga "6 0 3.2" "special case", sga "6 VII 1.6" "for a regular immersion"]
theorem IsRegularClosedImmersionOfCodim.isFiniteLocallyFreeOfRank_conormalModule
    {Z X : Scheme.{u}} (i : Z ⟶ X) [IsClosedImmersion i] {c : ℕ}
    (h : IsRegularClosedImmersionOfCodim i c) :
    _root_.AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.IsFiniteLocallyFreeOfRank.{u, u, u}
      (Stacks.Chow.conormalModule i) c := by
  have := Stacks.Chow.isFiniteLocallyFree_conormalModule i h.isRegularImmersion
  refine Scheme.Modules.isFiniteLocallyFreeOfRank_of_forall_fiberRank_eq _ c fun z => ?_
  obtain ⟨V, hzV, r, f, hker, hr, hw⟩ :=
    (isRegularClosedImmersionOfCodim_iff_kerGeneratedBy i c).mp h (i z)
      (subset_closure ⟨z, rfl⟩)
  subst hr
  exact Stacks.Conormal.fiberRank_conormalSheaf_eq_of_isQuasiRegular i V.2
    (by rw [Stacks.Conormal.coborderRange_eq_top i]; exact le_top) f
    (Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.isQuasiRegular_of_isWeaklyRegular _ hw) hker hzV

end Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.RegularIdealSheaf

end
